  "body": "Positioned on prime freehold land in Stanmore Bay, this well-presented residence blends contemporary styling with warmth, comfort and effortless living.\r\n\r\nInside, you'll find three generous bedrooms, a stylish tiled bathroom, separate toilet and a feature fireplace that adds character and appeal to the living space.\r\n\r\nSeamlessly extending the home outdoors, the spacious deck is perfectly positioned to expand the living area, entertain guests, enjoy alfresco dining or simply relax in the sun. With a wonderful indoor-outdoor connection, it's a space you'll love enjoying year-round.\r\n\r\nOutside, you'll discover a spacious, fully fenced backyard, complete with established fruit trees, a vegetable garden and garden shed. Whether it's a safe space for children and pets, a place to entertain or somewhere to enjoy a little homegrown produce, there's plenty of room to make it your own.\r\n\r\nPracticality hasn't been overlooked either, with a carpeted single garage offering plenty of room for your vehicle, beach gear, bikes, tools and all the essentials of coastal living.\r\n\r\nLocation is another major drawcard. Enjoy an easy stroll to Stanmore Bay Shopping Centre, with Stanmore Bay Beach, local schools and public transport all conveniently close by. Embrace the relaxed lifestyle of this fantastic beachside community while remaining within easy reach of Auckland.\r\n\r\nLooking to the future, the upcoming Penlink project is set to further enhance connectivity to the peninsula, adding to the area's appeal and potential for long-term growth.\r\n\r\nTastefully presented and offering flexible living spaces both inside and out, this is an opportunity to secure your own slice of Stanmore Bay.\r\n\r\nVacant and available for immediate possession – this property will be sold.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your opportunity to make it yours.",
